'''Ecto''' is a [[common Weapons|common]] knife that was originally obtainable by unboxing it from the [[2017 Halloween Box|Halloween Box]] during the [[Halloween Event 2017|2017 Halloween Event]]. It is now only obtainable through trading as the event has since ended.

==Appearance ==
Its blade and guard are bright green in color with a seemingly slimy texture overtop of it. The handle is solid black.

== Trivia ==

* The idea was from Mochi Monsters, more specifically a moshling called “Ecto”.

